      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91417c522e663e5236079adb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "葛城王牌绝不是千明代表的附属品，\n而是她的竞争对手。\n也是走在时代最前线的赛马娘之一。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7af9837650091c50efcb54214d81e65b328547cbee3090d72c4d9293321cd3ba",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104312.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        70,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/70/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6d877fda4558233637f2a09",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "把中距离练到极致吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "5da3b29c934470836af9bc6026c85f379d291f3e88204225817514d16bbcf315",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104312.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        71,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/71/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6958b7195c478e1529167f3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然人们并不如此看待葛城王牌，\n那现在该做的就是提升她的存在感，\n不顾意愿强行闯入人们的视线里──",
      "source_fingerprint": "11a0cfb4841155d494c73176b7836a6d3ea4ce11d442be75bced37410510040d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104312.json",
      "json_path": [
