      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "光是上榜或取得好成绩都还不够。\n必须在两场比赛中都拿下第一名才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f290f111052f620f63bbff262039b8f244eaa77e76f865287bb4629cc93c882",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
