      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就这样，下一场目标竞赛决定是“大阪杯”，\n为了证明自己是中距离最强的\n征程就要开始了──",
      "source_fingerprint": "e57e70d9dedaf4a778338065d86919bc47fa8a3597ef72f9d37f8a3a52acc59c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
