      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "千明代表将缺席冬季之后的\n闪耀系列赛，对此，\n世人难以掩饰内心的失望……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1f5e87350491fe6ffa026dd8f01199a714b1891bff19eb02255c20038f11fa4",
